181
00:11:00,093 --> 00:11:02,277
I don't get why Brooke is acting so weird.

182
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:03,977
Why did he turn against us?

183
00:11:04,060 --> 00:11:04,942
There's no way.

184
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:07,277
A true swordsman would
never betray his friends.

185
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:08,960
Yo-ho-ho-ho!

186
00:11:09,220 --> 00:11:11,797
I've simply reawakened
my true artistic nature.

187
00:11:11,880 --> 00:11:14,677
Bringing forth new creations
is my only reason for living,

188
00:11:14,760 --> 00:11:17,677
