am very dead, of course.

189
00:11:17,760 --> 00:11:18,590
Sing it!

190
00:11:18,900 --> 00:11:21,577
For these peasants can't
understand us, soul king.

191
00:11:21,660 --> 00:11:23,660
We only want to express ourselves.

192
00:11:23,820 --> 00:11:25,644
They'll never know our passion.

193
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:28,680
Life is the greatest art.

194
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:29,920
