195
00:11:34,280 --> 00:11:35,110
It's not!

196
00:11:35,193 --> 00:11:36,097
Someone help me!

197
00:11:36,180 --> 00:11:38,400
I'm fine doesn't hurt really.

198
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:40,460
I moved beyond tears.

199
00:11:40,800 --> 00:11:45,197
Look how I've exquisitely depicted
the tragedy of dress Rosa in about ten

200
00:11:45,280 --> 00:11:49,515
Minutes these rooms will be completely
fused with my latest masterpiece.

201
00:11:50,860 --> 00:11:53,625
Choking to death and
turning into a still life.

202
00:11:57,860 --> 00:12:01,617
It's simply splendid—you must let
me compose a song for your exhibit!

203
00:12:01,700 --> 00:12:05,480
exhibit But, uh, first, could you
change my violin and bow back?

204
00:12:05,800 --> 00:12:06,720
You got it.

205
