Out of necessity,

237
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:06,824
the countries needed to select new kings
to govern and replace the missing rulers.

238
00:14:06,940 --> 00:14:10,140
For instance, in the case
of my native Dressrosa,

239
00:14:10,960 --> 00:14:14,195
the Rick family was selected
to govern over the island.

240
00:14:14,740 --> 00:14:17,777
And the old royalty who
chose to move to the

241
00:14:17,860 --> 00:14:20,820
Holy Land of Marie Joie
all those years ago.

242
00:14:22,920 --> 00:14:24,940
The Don Quixote family.

243
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:37,217
I was worried about Nami
long before you ever were,

244
00:14:37,300 --> 00:14:40,737
and if she wants anyone to come
save her, it's definitely me,

245
00:14:40,820 --> 00:14:46,137
so you let me handle this then
get going already, Kin'emon,

246
00:14:46,220 --> 00:14:49,737
