where your friend is being held.

247
00:14:49,820 --> 00:14:54,737
I am eternally grateful
when you see Luffy again!

248
00:14:54,820 --> 00:14:56,761
And contact the Sunny using this.

249
00:14:56,920 --> 00:14:59,155
We need to check everyone's situation.

250
00:14:59,320 --> 00:15:00,849
I'll stay aboard the ship.

251
00:15:04,880 --> 00:15:07,460
So, any idea how we reach him?

252
00:15:07,780 --> 00:15:11,721
If I knew, do you think we'd be
